 None None | n= 1 | exit: Lower offer than rivals | inf: None | sort: 2016-07-27 00:00:00 | from: 2016-07-27 00:00:00 to: 2016-07-27 00:00:00 | flag: None\n37 | 08/01/2016 | Party D | Financial | Bid | P 1 | R 3 | 24 24 | Not stated Formal Heavy | n= 1 | exit: None | inf: None | sort: 2016-08-01 00:00:00 | from: 2016-08-01 00:00:00 to: 2016-08-01 00:00:00 | flag: None\n38 | 08/01/2016 | Party E | Strategic | Bid | P 1 | R 3 | 23.81 23.81 | Not stated Informal Heavy | n= 1 | exit: None | inf: None | sort: 2016-08-01 00:00:00 | from: 2016-08-01 00:00:00 to: 2016-08-01 00:00:00 | flag: None\n39 | 08/02/2016 | Party E | Strategic | Bid | P 1 | R 3 | 21.26 21.26 | Not stated Informal Heavy | n= 1 | exit: None | inf: None | sort: 2016-08-02 00:00:00 | from: 2016-08-02 00:00:00 to: 2016-08-02 00:00:00 | flag: None\n40 | 08/02/2016 | Party D | Financial | Withdrew | P 1 | R 3 | None None | None None None | n= 1 | exit: Terms or process | inf: None | sort: 2016-08-02 00:00:00 | from: 2016-08-02 00:00:00 to: 2016-08-02 00:00:00 | flag: None\n41 | by 08/04/2016 | Party E | Strategic | Dropped by target | P 1 | R 3 | None None | None None None | n= 1 | exit: Not stated | inf: Y | sort: 2016-08-04 00:00:00 | from: None to: 2016-08-04 00:00:00 | flag: Q5\n42 | 08/04/2016 | Party B | Strategic | Bid reaffirmed | P 1 | R 3 | 24 24 | Not stated Formal Light | n= 1 | exit: None | inf: None | sort: 2016-08-04 00:00:00 | from: 2016-08-04 00:00:00 to: 2016-08-04 00:00:00 | flag: Q4\n43 | 08/09/2016 | G&W | Strategic | Other material event | P 1 | R 3 | None None | None None None | n= 1 | exit: None | inf: None | sort: 2016-08-09 00:00:00 | from: 2016-08-09 00:00:00 to: 2016-08-09 00:00:00 | flag: None\n44 | 08/10/2016 | Simpson Thacher | None | Adviser | P 1 | R 3 | None None | None None None | n= None | exit: None | inf: None | sort: 2016-08-10 00:00:00 | from: 2016-08-10 00:00:00 to: 2016-08-10 00:00:00 | flag: None\n45 | 08/12/2016 | G&W | Strategic | Bid | P 1 | R 3 | 25 25 | Yes Formal None | n= 1 | exit: None | inf: None | sort: 2016-08-12 00:00:00 | from: 2016-08-12 00:00:00 to: 2016-08-12 00:00:00 | flag: None\n46 | 08/12/2016 | Party B | Strategic | Not selected at signing | P 1 | R 3 | None None | None None None | n= 1 | exit: Would not improve earlier offer | inf: None | sort: 2016-08-12 00:00:00 | from: 2016-08-12 00:00:00 to: 2016-08-12 00:00:00 | flag: None\n47 | 08/12/2016 | PWRR and G&W | None | Merger agreement signed | P 1 | R 3 | None None | None None None | n= None | exit: None | inf: None | sort: 2016-08-12 00:00:00 | from: 2016-08-12 00:00:00 to: 2016-08-12 00:00:00 | flag: None\n48 | 08/15/2016 | PWRR | None | Merger announced | P 1 | R post | None None | None None None | n= None | exit: None | inf: None | sort: 2016-08-15 00:00:00 | from: 2016-08-15 00:00:00 to: 2016-08-15 00:00:00 | flag: None\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /tmp/opencode/pw && python3 - <<'EOF'\\nfrom openpyxl import load_workbook\\nwb = load_workbook('/home/uctpiaj/work/extraction/providence-worcester.xlsx')\\nprint(\\\"sheets:\\\", wb.sheetnames)\\nfor name in wb.sheetnames:\\n    ws = wb[name]\\n    print(\\\"---\\\", name, \\\"dims\\\", ws.dimensions, \\\"freeze\\\", ws.freeze_panes, \\\"filter\\\", ws.auto_filter.ref, \\\"merged\\\", list(ws.merged_cells.ranges))\\n    print(\\\"   header:\\\", [c.value for c in ws[1]])\\nws = wb['Deal ledger']\\nfor r in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2, values_only=True):\\n    print(r[0], \\\"|\\\", r[1], \\\"|\\\", r[2], \\\"|\\\", r[3], \\\"|\\\", r[4], \\\"| P\\\", r[5], \\\"| R\\\", r[6], \\\"|\\\", r[7], r[8], \\\"|\\\", r[9], r[10], r[11], \\\"| n=\\\", r[12], \\\"| exit:\\\", r[13], \\\"| inf:\\\", r[14], \\\"| sort:\\\", r[19], \\\"| from:\\\", r[20], \\\"to:\\\", r[21], \\\"| flag:\\\", r[17])\\nEOF\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825603884,"end":1789825604912}}}}
